{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-09_end","storyGroup":"main_16","storySort":246,"storyDependence":"main_16_level_main_16-09_end","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"16-9","storyName":"疯人的辩护","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"精神失常的矿工坚信他必须杀死这里的村民，就像抢夺载具时，他必须杀死自己的孩子。而在一场席卷整个村庄的大火中，雷尔金以为自己的噩梦成真。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_main_16-09_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"main_16-08","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":9,"next":11,"characters":["霍里","尼克托","雷尔金","激动的矿工","别乔克","年迈的妇人"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":6},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":7},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_66_g14_ursusvillage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":8},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"乌萨斯的深秋，夜晚的气温骤降。寒风席卷，吹得枝桠上的积雪纷纷飘落。","id":11},{"type":"text","text":"空地上，人群早已散去，远处错落的矮屋也看不到一户亮灯。","id":12},{"type":"text","text":"空地中央的火堆里，烧焦的木柴上依然残存着一丝火焰，火苗被北风一遍遍撕扯，延续着最后的喘息。","id":13},{"type":"dialog","id":14},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":15},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firewood_throw","volume":"1","id":16},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_warmbonfire_loop","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"0","id":17},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","fadetime":"2","channel":"a","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":19},{"type":"text","text":"一根粗壮的木柴被扔进了火堆中，扬起的火星在空中飘散。","id":20},{"type":"dialog","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1971_1#1$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"他们……","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"知道了我们的行踪。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":25},{"type":"text","text":"干燥的木柴躺在焦炭中，渐渐被熏黑，变形，随后被突然蹿起的火焰完全淹没。","id":26},{"type":"text","text":"火光映照在虚弱的感染者的面庞上，可他却感受不到一丝温暖。","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1971_1#1$1","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"这些人。这里的……所有人。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"只有把他们也抹去……就像抹去加尼亚……","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1971_1#7$1","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"他们才不必……","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"不必丧失道德，不必背弃纯洁……","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"不必玷污灵魂。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":35},{"type":"text","text":"他很疼，钻心地疼，像被针尖穿透。","id":36},{"type":"text","text":"他很冷，冷得不住颤抖，像掉入冰冻的湖泊。","id":37},{"type":"text","text":"他必须让自己暖和起来。","id":38},{"type":"dialog","id":39},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firewood_throw","volume":"0.2","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":41},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firewood_throw","volume":"0.5","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":43},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firewood_throw","volume":"1","id":44},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":45},{"type":"text","text":"一根，两根，三根。","id":46},{"type":"text","text":"一捆，两捆，三捆。","id":47},{"type":"text","text":"原本微弱的火苗从木头的缝隙中钻出，变成一只炽热的魔鬼，它的火舌几乎要刺到点火者的身体。","id":48},{"type":"text","text":"瘦弱的矿工拾起一根燃烧的木棍，向寂静的房屋走去。","id":49},{"type":"dialog","id":50},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":51},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"1","id":52},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":53},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"charslot","id":56},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_bg_bg_newiceforest_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":57},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":59},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":60},{"type":"text","text":"噔，哒。噔，哒。","id":61},{"type":"text","text":"有节奏的脚步声，一轻一重，一强一弱。","id":62},{"type":"dialog","id":63},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"1","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1971_1#4$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":65},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"睡着……睡着！","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"全都睡着。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"你们不知道自己会面临怎样的困境，会面对怎样的审判。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1971_1#5$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"帮助和包藏感染者，然后将他们出卖。无知的人，温驯如驮兽！","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":72},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1971_1#1$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"不过，没关系。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"我会帮助你们，我能帮助你们。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1971_1#2$1","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"……因为我愿意默想……","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"并分担……","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1971_1#6$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"你们的痛苦。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":82},{"type":"text","text":"狂徒手握恐惧的火把，但零星的火焰已经不能抑制他的寒冷。","id":83},{"type":"text","text":"他感到冰冷刺骨。寒气来自矿石病，来自寒风，来自乌萨斯。","id":84},{"type":"text","text":"他需要更多的温暖。","id":85},{"type":"text","text":"突然间，一大堆干草出现在他的视野中。","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1971_1#1$1","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"一场火。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":89},{"type":"text","text":"他抛下火把。","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1971_1#4$1","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"一场净化——","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":93},{"type":"text","text":"火舌唤醒了所有枯萎。","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1971_1#5$1","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"一次拯救！","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":97},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":98},{"type":"playsound","key":"$firestorm","volume":"1","id":99},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act37d0d0/m_bat_act37d0d0_01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":100,"musicid":0},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_062cg_phantom_front","fade":"true","fadetime":"1.5","layer":"1","id":101},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"0","id":102},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.7","fadetime":"2","channel":"a","id":103},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":104},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":105},{"type":"text","text":"他从未如此清晰地感觉到，自己活着。","id":106},{"type":"dialog","id":107},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":110},{"type":"charslot","id":111},{"type":"bgeffect","id":112},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_34_g10_tent_inside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":114},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":116},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":118},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":120},{"type":"text","text":"脑内持续地嗡鸣，雷尔金努力想从噩梦中抢夺回一丝感知与理智。","id":121},{"type":"text","text":"五感正在一点点恢复，可哀嚎声仍没有远去，反而越来越近。","id":122},{"type":"text","text":"他强撑着身体，蹒跚着朝帐篷外走去，想要呼吸一口新鲜的空气。","id":123},{"type":"dialog","id":124},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":125},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":126},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":127},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"charslot","id":129},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smoke_01","layer":"1","id":130},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutry_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":131},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"0","id":132},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","fadetime":"2","channel":"a","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":134},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":136},{"type":"text","text":"灼热的空气扑面而来，身上的冷汗几乎立刻便被蒸发。","id":137},{"type":"text","text":"一瞬间，所有的感觉全部回到了体内，刺激着雷尔金的身体。","id":138},{"type":"text","text":"这里不是梦境，这里是现实。噩梦中的场景在现实中被延续。","id":139},{"type":"text","text":"四处都是逃窜的人群，那些曾给人们提供庇护的房屋，现在正被火焰摧枯拉朽地吞没。","id":140},{"type":"text","text":"升腾的浓烟里，那些焦苦绝望的气息如同魔爪死死扼住每个人的喉咙，人在这威压之下，渺小如蚁。","id":141},{"type":"dialog","id":142},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1967_1#5$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尼克托","text":"雷尔金！","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1967_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#6$1","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"这里……发生了什么？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1967_1#5$1","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尼克托","text":"不知道，火是突然间蹿起来的。这个火势我们根本没法扑灭！","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1967_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尼克托","text":"我们现在能做的只有疏散大家！","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1967_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"charslot","id":153},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"1","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.6","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.8","id":157},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的矿工","text":"雷尔金，我们换来的粮食都还在里面，我得进去——","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"哪里还有功夫管这种事！","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"去把所有人叫醒！让所有人逃到村子外面去！快，快走！","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":164},{"type":"text","text":"可火场里的人群并没有因为雷尔金的话变得更有秩序，恐惧在肆无忌惮地蔓延。","id":165},{"type":"dialog","id":166},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0","channel":"a","fadetime":"0.5","id":167},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":168},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":169},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":170},{"type":"charslot","id":171},{"type":"background","id":172},{"type":"bgeffect","id":173},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bc/Avg_avg_8_30.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"0","id":174},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":175},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"1","keep":"true","id":176},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":177},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":178},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":179},{"type":"text","text":"他从未……","id":180},{"type":"text","text":"死去。","id":181},{"type":"dialog","id":182},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":185},{"type":"charslot","id":186},{"type":"image","id":187},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smoke_01","layer":"1","id":188},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutry_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":189},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#7$1","id":191},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"a","fadetime":"0.5","id":192},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"不，这不对……我赢了，我杀死了他！","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"我能救所有人……！","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":197},{"type":"charslot","id":198},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"r","id":199},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"r","fadetime":"1","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4207_branch_1#6$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"别乔克","text":"老师！","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_4207_branch_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#6$1","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"别乔克，你怎么在这？快到安全的地方去！","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4207_branch_1#10$1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"别乔克","text":"老师，我、我……！","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4207_branch_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#7$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"你听不懂我的话吗？！","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":210},{"type":"text","text":"雷尔金想甩开别乔克的手，可小女孩使尽全身力气拽住了他的手臂。","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4207_branch_1#10$1","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"别乔克","text":"奶奶，奶奶，她、她，不见了！","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4207_branch_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#6$1","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"什么……？你不是一直跟她在一起吗？","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"text","text":"口吃的女孩双手并用，试图解释发生了什么，可她恐惧的表情已经说明了一切。","id":217},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#5$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"尼克托！","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"你继续疏散大家，我跟别乔克去找娜迦夫人！","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1967_1#1$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尼克托","text":"好、好！","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1967_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":226},{"type":"charslot","id":227},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":228},{"type":"text","text":"雷尔金和别乔克穿梭在火场之中。两侧房屋烧燎，稍不注意，他们的衣服就会被火点燃。","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4207_branch_1#10$1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"别乔克","text":"奶奶……呜，呜，奶奶！","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4207_branch_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":232},{"type":"text","text":"雷尔金也想大声呼喊，可无力感在他的心中不断累积，堵住了他的咽喉，让他难以发声，让他难以呼吸。","id":233},{"type":"text","text":"他很清楚，如此猛烈的大火，对于一个行动困难的老者来说意味着什么。","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4207_branch_1#10$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"别乔克","text":"老、老师，我……您……唔……唔！","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4207_branch_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":237},{"type":"text","text":"冒着黑烟的十字路口，别乔克捂住嘴指了指自己，又指了指雷尔金，最后指向了路的分岔处。","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#10$1","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"不，不行……别乔克，你不能和我分开行动……你听我说……","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4207_branch_1#10$1","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"别乔克","text":"老师！","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4207_branch_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":243},{"type":"text","text":"女孩此刻涨红着脸，豆大的泪珠从她的双眸中涌出。她将双手交握，做出一种奇异的、虔诚的祈祷模样。","id":244},{"type":"text","text":"她不祈求皇帝，不祈求圣愚。她祈求雷尔金的帮助。","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#3$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"我……","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":248},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0","channel":"a","fadetime":"0.5","id":249},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":250},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":251},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":252},{"type":"charslot","id":253},{"type":"bgeffect","id":254},{"type":"background","id":255},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_8_29.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"0","id":256},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":257},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"1","keep":"true","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":259},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":260},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":261},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":262},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":263},{"type":"subtitle","text":"愚蠢。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":264},{"type":"subtitle","id":265},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":267},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"charslot","id":270},{"type":"image","id":271},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smoke_01","layer":"1","id":272},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutry_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":273},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":274},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4207_branch_1#5$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"0","id":275},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"a","fadetime":"0.5","id":276},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":278},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1971_1#7$1","focus":"m","posfrom":"-500,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1","id":280},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":281},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown3","volume":"1","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1971_1#7$1","focus":"m","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-230,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.4","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4207_branch_1#10$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.4","id":284},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"别乔克","text":"呜……！","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4207_branch_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-230,0","posto":"100,0","focus":"m","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":290},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":291},{"type":"charslot","id":292},{"type":"text","text":"一个黑影从两人的眼前闯过，他一瘸一拐，步伐却异常有力，仿佛被什么吸引了一般。","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#6$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"霍里？你要去哪？！","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":296},{"type":"text","text":"佝偻的背影并没有理会雷尔金的呼喊，他只是朝着路尽头的火海走去。","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"四面八方的火光驱散了他的影子，他如传闻中走向刑场的圣愚一样，像是要准备迎接火焰的沐浴。","id":298},{"type":"dialog","id":299},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4207_branch_1#1$1","posfrom":"-300,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"300,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":303},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":304},{"type":"charslot","id":305},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#7$1","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"别乔克，等等！","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"至此，我犯下杀戮的罪过。","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"不为食物，不为洁净的水，不为温暖的房屋。","id":311},{"type":"text","text":"他念诵着，步履不停，推开一扇燃烧的房门。","id":312},{"type":"dialog","id":313},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":314},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":316},{"type":"charslot","id":317},{"type":"background","id":318},{"type":"bgeffect","id":319},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_66_i23.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"0","id":320},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":321},{"type":"playsound","key":"$firestorm","volume":"1","id":322},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"0","id":323},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.7","fadetime":"2","channel":"a","id":324},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":325},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":327},{"type":"text","text":"雷尔金的视线越过霍里，即便火光持续灼烧着他的双眼，也无法阻止他看见房屋里的一切——","id":328},{"type":"text","text":"火焰狰狞翻腾，焦黑的梁柱摇摇晃晃，噼啪声如垂死者断断续续的呻吟。","id":329},{"type":"text","text":"然而，一位老妇却端坐在火焰间的方寸之地。","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年迈的妇人","text":"……","id":331},{"type":"text","text":"她坐在仅剩的椅子上，木然无声，火舌与她只有咫尺距离，却仿佛被一道无形的墙隔绝开来。","id":332},{"type":"text","text":"她周身纤尘不染，连头发也一丝不乱。她双眼微闭，又仿佛看着一切。","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍里","text":"至此，我洁净了他们的灵魂。","id":334},{"type":"dialog","id":335},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":336},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":337},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":338},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":339},{"type":"charslot","id":340},{"type":"background","id":341},{"type":"image","id":342}],"characters":["霍里","尼克托","雷尔金","激动的矿工","别乔克","年迈的妇人"]}